      "items": [
        {
          "field": "Acceptance Criteria",
          "fieldtype": "custom",
          "from_string": "*Desktop:*\n\n# Given a shopper clicks any image in the PDP on desktop, when the image is clicked, then a full-screen overlay opens with the gallery.\n# Given a shopper clicks on the “Gallery” CTA on the PDP, when the CTA is clicked, then a full-screen overlay opens with the gallery.\n# Given the overlay is open, when it renders, then the clicked image displays as the selected thumbnail and as a large image on the top of the page.\n# Given there are multiple colour variations, then the variations are displayed on the left as swatches and the selected colour from the PDP is also pre-selected in the gallery.\n# Given there are multiple colour variations, when the shopper selects another colour variation, then the gallery images are updated to match that colour variation without a full page reload.\n# Given the overlay is open, when it renders, then a horizontal thumbnail strip displays all gallery images as small thumbnails with the active image highlighted. \n# Given the overlay is open, when a shopper clicks a thumbnail, then the primary image updates to display the selected image.\n# Given the overlay is open, when a shopper scrolls the primary image panel, then they can navigate sequentially through all gallery images.\n# Given the overlay is open, when a shopper clicks the × button, then the overlay closes and focus returns to the PDP at the same scroll position.\n\n*Mobile:*\n\n# Given a shopper clicks on the “Gallery” CTA on the PDP, then a full-screen overlay opens with the gallery.\n# Given a shopper has opened the gallery, if applicable, then the colour variations are displayed as swatches at the top and the product images stacked below.\n# Given a shopper has opened the gallery, when they want to see all the product images, then the shopper will need to scroll down the page.\n# Given a shopper is on mobile, when they pinch on a gallery image, then pinch-to-zoom is supported.\n# Given the overlay is open, when a shopper clicks the × button, then the overlay closes and focus returns to the PDP at the same scroll position.",
          "to_string": "*Opening the gallery — desktop*\n\n# Given a shopper clicks any image in the gallery on the PDP, then the full-screen gallery overlay opens displaying the full image set as specified in the pdp/gallery component (SFCC-731).\n# Given a shopper clicks the View Gallery button on the PDP, then the full-screen gallery overlay opens as specified in the pdp/gallery component (SFCC-731).\n\n*Opening the gallery — mobile*\n\n# Given a shopper taps the View Gallery button on the PDP on mobile, then the full-screen gallery overlay opens as specified in the pdp/gallery component (SFCC-731).\n\n*Colour switching within the open gallery*\n\n# Given the gallery overlay is open and the product has multiple colour variations, when a shopper selects a different colour swatch, then the gallery images update to reflect that colour without closing the overlay.\n# Given a shopper selects a colour swatch within the open gallery that maps to a different master product ID in SFCC, then the overlay closes and the PDP reloads for the selected colour.\n\n*Closing the gallery*\n\n# Given a shopper closes the gallery overlay on desktop or mobile, then the overlay closes and the shopper is returned to the PDP at the same scroll position they were at before opening it.\n\n*Pinch to zoom — mobile*\n\n# Given a shopper has the gallery overlay open on mobile, then pinch-to-zoom is supported on individual images.",
          "from_id": "",
          "to_id": ""
        }
      ],
