        {
          "field": "description",
          "fieldtype": "jira",
          "from_string": "*As a* Shopper,\n\n*I want* to expand the product gallery into a full-screen view,\n\n*so that* I can examine product images in greater detail before making a purchase decision.\n\n----\n\n*Image for reference (Figma leading):*\n\n\n!image-20260716-065206.png|width=420,alt=\"image-20260716-065206.png\"!\n\n\n\nOn desktop, clicking any image in the gallery opens a full-screen overlay. The selected image displays large at the top with a scrollable image list. A thumbnail strip at the top shows all gallery images as small thumbnails; the active image is highlighted. The overlay is dismissible via a close (×) button or by clicking outside the image area.\n\nOn mobile, pinch-to-zoom is supported within the scrollable gallery.",
          "to_string": "*As a* Shopper,\n\n*I want* to expand the product gallery into a full-screen view,\n\n*so that* I can examine product images in greater detail before making a purchase decision.\n\n----\n\n*Image for reference (Figma leading):*\n\n\n!image-20260716-065206.png|width=420,alt=\"image-20260716-065206.png\"!"
        }
      ],
