          "field": "description",
          "fieldtype": "jira",
          "from_string": "*As a* Shopper,\n\n*I want* to expand the product gallery into a full-screen view,\n\n*so that* I can examine product images in greater detail before making a purchase decision.\n\n----\n\nOn desktop, clicking any image in the gallery opens a full-screen overlay with a dark background. The selected image displays large on the left with a vertically scrollable image list. A thumbnail strip on the right shows all gallery images as small thumbnails; the active image is highlighted. The overlay is dismissible via a close (×) button or by clicking outside the image area.\n\nOn mobile, pinch-to-zoom is supported within the swipeable gallery — no separate open state is required on mobile.\n\nDepends on SFCC-186 (PDP – Product Image Gallery) — the closed state must exist before the open state can be built.",
